   "date": "2017-07-28T17:09:36Z",
   "subject": "No validate() message displayed for ‘non-flickering’ DT",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>I had relied on <font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>sliderInput</b></font>s to ensure that only valid entries be displayed in a DT coded to eliminate re-rendering of the entire table whenever an input changes. (<i>see</i> the final comment (by yihui) at <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/DT/issues/168\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/DT/issues/168&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389297790000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QxOjTnjj4WBR4KbkNLkPB\">https://github.com/rstudio/DT/issues/168</a>)<br></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>After swapping some <b style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">sliderInput</b>s for <b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">numericInput</font></b>s (to satisfy a user), I added validation code for the new <b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">numericInput</font></b>s.<span> </span></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>This worked fine — <i>i.e.</i>, the validation message was displayed as needed — when the output was either a ggplot or (I found by playing around) a ’flickering’ DT — one for which the data was un-wrapped from <font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>isolate()</b></font> in the server function call to <b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">DT::renderDataTable()</font></b>.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>The behaviors of flickering and non-flickering DTs are illustrated in the following code.</p>\r\n<p><br></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    titlePanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Inputs&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>        numericInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;numeric_input&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;This entry must be &gt; 300!&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>        sliderInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;slider_input&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Some other input&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> min </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> max </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>      mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>        h4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;The Non-flickering DT&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> align </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;center&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tags$li</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;GOOD: doesn\\&#39;t re-render entire table when change valid entry&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tags$li</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;BAD: does not display validation message when numeric input &lt;= 300&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        br</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;non_flickering_dt&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>        hr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>        h4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;The Flickering DT&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> align </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;center&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tags$li</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;BAD: does re-render entire table when change valid entry&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tags$li</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;GOOD: displays validation message when numeric input &lt;= 300&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        br</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;flickering_dt&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># &#39;need&#39;-type validation function ----</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    good_to_go </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$numeric_input </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">300</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># an arbitrary requirement on &#39;integer&#39; </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        NULL                                 </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># test passed, proceed...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Input gotta be greater than 300!&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># test failed, display message...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># df to display in each DT ----</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    my_data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># first, validate input</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      validate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        good_to_go</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># if input valid, build the df</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Name</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;My Integer&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                 </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;My Slider&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Value</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">character</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$numeric_input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                               input$slider_input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>        stringsAsFactors </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE<br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># display proxy-supported NON-FLICKERING DT ----</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#  * error msg IS NOT displayed on invalid input</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#  * data wrapped in isolate()</span><span style=\"color:#800\"> </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># details in final comment (by yihui) at <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/DT/issues/168\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/DT/issues/168&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389297790000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QxOjTnjj4WBR4KbkNLkPB\">https://github.com/rstudio/DT/issues/168</a></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    output$non_flickering_dt </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>      rownames </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>      isolate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">my_data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># wrap data in isolate() to eliminate re-rendering the whole megillah </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># proxy for non-flickering DT</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    proxy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataTableProxy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;non_flickering_dt&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    observe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>      replaceData</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">proxy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> my_data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rownames </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE<br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># display FLICKERING DT ---- </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#  * error msg IS displayed on invalid input</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#  * data NOT wrapped in isolate()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    output$flickering_dt </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>      rownames </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">my_data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()}</span><span style=\"color:#000\">        </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># data not wrapped in isolate()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><p><br></p><p><br></p>\r\n<p>I thus far have been unable to get the desired effect: no flickering — which requires wrapping the data in <b style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">isolate()</b> — and displaying an error message when invalid data are entered in an input.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>I apparently do not understand the reactive model well enough to work around this issue and will appreciate any guidance.</p>\r\n<p><br></p><p><br></p>\r\n<p>——————</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>RStudio 1.0.143</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>&gt; sessionInfo()</p>\r\n<p>R version 3.4.0 (2017-04-21)</p>\r\n<p>Platform: x86_64-apple-darwin15.6.0 (64-bit)</p>\r\n<p>Running under: macOS Sierra 10.12.6</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>attached base packages:</p>\r\n<p>[1] stats <span>    </span>graphics<span>  </span>grDevices utils <span>    </span>datasets<span>  </span>methods <span>  </span>base<span>     </span></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>other attached packages:</p>\r\n<p>[1] DT_0.2<span>      </span>shiny_1.0.3</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>loaded via a namespace (and not attached):</p>\r\n<p><span> </span>[1] Rcpp_0.12.12<span>      </span>digest_0.6.12 <span>    </span>rprojroot_1.2 <span>    </span>mime_0.5<span>          </span>R6_2.2.2<span>          </span>jsonlite_1.5<span>     </span></p>\r\n<p><span> </span>[7] xtable_1.8-2<span>      </span>backports_1.1.0 <span>  </span>magrittr_1.5<span>      </span>evaluate_0.10.1 <span>  </span>stringi_1.1.5 <span>    </span>rstudioapi_0.6<span>   </span></p>\r\n<p>[13] rmarkdown_1.6 <span>    </span>tools_3.4.0 <span>      </span>stringr_1.2.0 <span>    </span>htmlwidgets_0.9 <span>  </span>yaml_2.1.14 <span>      </span>rsconnect_0.8 <span>   </span></p>\r\n<p>[19] httpuv_1.3.5<span>      </span>compiler_3.4.0<span>    </span>sourcetools_0.1.6 htmltools_0.3.6 <span>  </span>knitr_1.16</p></div>"
